gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\"><a aria-label=\"Търсене\" class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white p-2 rounded hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tarsene\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white/10 text-[15px] font-semibold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative w-4 h-3\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-0\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-3\"></span></span>Меню</button></div></div></header><!--/$--><main class=\"flex-1 min-h-[100svh]\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 max-w-[88rem]\"><div class=\"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] w-screen bg-surface -mt-8 sm:-mt-12 mb-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12\"><p class=\"text-[15px] text-green font-semibold mb-2\">52-то Народно събрание</p><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\">Парламент</h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Всяко поименно гласуване: кой как гласува, как гласува всяка група и какво е прието.</div></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3 mb-12 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:col-span-2 sm:[&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:col-span-1\"><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col\"><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] text-muted\">Гласувания</p><p class=\"display num text-[2rem] sm:text-[3.4rem] leading-none mt-2 break-words text-ink\">1723</p><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] mt-2\">от 30 април 2026 г. до 20 ноември 2026 г.</p><div class=\"mt-auto pt-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-xs sm:text-sm\"></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col\"><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] text-muted\">Отхвърлени предложения</p><p class=\"display num text-[2rem] sm:text-[3.4rem] leading-none mt-2 break-words text-ink\">620</p><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] mt-2\">36% от всички гласувания</p><div class=\"mt-auto pt-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-xs sm:text-sm\"></div></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-lg p-4 sm:p-5 flex flex-col\"><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] text-muted\">Депутати в периода</p><p class=\"display num text-[2rem] sm:text-[3.4rem] leading-none mt-2 break-words text-ink\">254</p><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-[15px] mt-2\">включително заместили други</p><div class=\"mt-auto pt-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-xs sm:text-sm\"></div></div></div><a class=\"block ring-2 ring-red rounded-sm p-4 mb-10 bg-white no-underline text-ink hover:ring-4\" href=\"/parlament/signali\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-lg\">Сигнали: текстове, добавени на второ четене →</p><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted\">Нови параграфи, особено в преходните и заключителните разпоредби, където често се променят други закони в полза на тесен кръг. Кой ги подкрепя.</p></a><p class=\"mb-8 -mt-4 text-[15px]\"><a class=\"font-semibold\" href=\"/parlament/zakoni\">Всички закони: етап, вносители, двете страни и сигнали</a> · <a href=\"/vlast\">Властта накратко</a> · <a href=\"/parlament/predishni\">Предишните парламенти (49–51)</a> · <a href=\"/parlament/zayaveno\">Заявено и гласувано</a> · <a hr